  "<symbol=button_maru><symbol=button_maru><symbol=button_maru>for Phoenix Frenzy.": "",
  "<symbol=button_maru> to grab, then <symbol=button_maru> to throw or <symbol=button_shikaku> to attack.": "",
  "<symbol=button_maru> to grab, then move to a wall. <symbol=button_sankaku> when the Heat icon is displayed.": "",
  "<symbol=button_options>to equip Poison Rounds in Equipment.\n<symbol=button_sankaku> to fire Poison Rounds.": "",
