  "Press <symbol=button_batsu> to evade or <symbol=button_l1> to parry enemy attacks. If you are armed, <symbol=button_l1> allows you to use your weapon to guard.": "<symbol=button_batsu>で回避　<symbol=button_l1>で受け流し\n武器を持っている場合は<symbol=button_l1>でガードが可能です。",
  "While evading with <symbol=button_batsu>, press <symbol=button_batsu> or <symbol=button_l_stick>+<symbol=button_batsu> to roll away from danger.": "<symbol=button_batsu>で回避中に<symbol=button_batsu>あるいは<symbol=button_l_stick>＋<symbol=button_batsu>\n転がって大きく避けることができます。",
  "While evading with <symbol=button_batsu>, press <symbol=button_maru> to grab the enemy as you dodge.": "<symbol=button_batsu>で回避中に<symbol=button_maru>\n敵の攻撃を避けつつ掴むことができます。",
  "As you dodge with <symbol=button_batsu>, use <symbol=button_sankaku> to attack during evasive moves.": "<symbol=button_batsu>で回避中に<symbol=button_sankaku>\n回避中に攻撃を繰り出します。",
  "While evading with <symbol=button_batsu>, use <symbol=button_sankaku> to unleash attacks during evasive moves.": "<symbol=button_batsu>で回避中に<symbol=button_sankaku>\n回避中に攻撃を繰り出します。",
  "While using <symbol=button_batsu> to evade, press <symbol=button_shikaku> to deliver slashing attacks from a dodge.": "<symbol=button_batsu>で回避中に<symbol=button_shikaku>\n回避中に斬撃を行います。",
  "As you evade with <symbol=button_batsu>, use <symbol=button_shikaku> to shoot or tackle your enemy from a dodge.": "<symbol=button_batsu>で回避中に<symbol=button_shikaku>\n回避中に銃撃、または体当たりで攻撃を行います。",
  "While guarding with <symbol=button_l1>, press <symbol=button_sankaku> to deflect the enemy's attack and gain a chance to counter.": "<symbol=button_l1>で防御中に<symbol=button_sankaku>\n敵の攻撃を弾き返して反撃の好機を作ります。",
  "While guarding with <symbol=button_l1>, press <symbol=button_sankaku> to reflect the enemy's attack and gain the chance to strike back.": "<symbol=button_l1>長押しで防御中に<symbol=button_sankaku>\n敵の攻撃を弾き返して反撃の好機を作ります。",
  "You can use <symbol=button_left><symbol=button_up><symbol=button_right> and <symbol=button_down> to switch between styles. \nNow, press <symbol=button_up> and switch to the Wild Dancer.": "<symbol=button_left>　<symbol=button_up>　<symbol=button_right>　<symbol=button_down>　で型を切り替えられます。\nここでは、<symbol=button_up>を入力して\n「乱舞の型」に切り替えてみましょう。",
  "<symbol=button_maru> Phoenix Frenzy\n Press <symbol=button_maru> <symbol=button_maru> <symbol=button_maru> to chain up to three special attacks.": "<symbol=button_maru>で乱れ技　鳳凰陣\n<symbol=button_maru><symbol=button_maru><symbol=button_maru>で三段目まで繋がる特殊連撃です。",
  "Press <symbol=button_maru> to grab, then <symbol=button_maru> to throw or <symbol=button_shikaku> to attack. Grabbing is often effective against guarding enemies.": "<symbol=button_maru>で掴み　<symbol=button_maru>で投げ　<symbol=button_shikaku>で攻撃\n防御している敵には掴みが有効です。",
  "Press <symbol=button_maru> to grab an enemy, then move to a wall and press <symbol=button_sankaku> once the Heat icon is displayed in the top right to perform a Heat Action.": "<symbol=button_maru>で敵を掴み、壁際まで移動して<symbol=button_sankaku>\n画面右上に「極」と表示されれば発動可能です。",
  "Press <symbol=button_options> to open the Pause Menu and equip Poison Rounds. Poison Rounds can inflict poison damage on the enemy.": "<symbol=button_options>でメインメニューを開いて\n毒弾を装備して撃ってみましょう。\n\n毒弾は当たった敵を毒状態にできます。",
  "Press <symbol=button_options> to open the Pause Menu and equip Acid Rounds. Acid Rounds can dissolve the enemy's armor.": "<symbol=button_options>でメインメニューを開いて\n酸性弾を装備して撃ってみましょう。\n\n酸性弾は敵の鎧を溶かすことができます。",
  "Press <symbol=button_options> to open the Pause Menu and equip Flash Rounds. Flash Rounds can blind and incapacitate the enemy.": "<symbol=button_options>でメインメニューを開いて\n閃光弾を装備して撃ってみましょう。\n\n閃光弾は敵の目をくらませて無力化します。",
  "Press <symbol=button_options> to open the Pause Menu and equip Thunder Rounds. Thunder Rounds can paralyze and incapacitate the enemy.": "<symbol=button_options>でメインメニューを開いて\n雷撃弾を装備して撃ってみましょう。\n\n雷撃弾は敵を痺れさせて無力化します。",
  "Hold <symbol=button_r1> to take a fighting stance, then press <symbol=button_maru> just before an enemy attack connects to disarm them.": "<symbol=button_r1>で構えて、敵の攻撃が当たる直前に<symbol=button_maru>\n敵の攻撃を巻き上げ、稀に武器を弾き飛ばします。",
  "While in the <symbol=button_r1> stance, press <symbol=button_sankaku> just before an enemy attack connects to deliver a powerful counterattack.": "<symbol=button_r1>で構えて、敵の攻撃が当たる直前に<symbol=button_sankaku>\n一瞬の隙を突き、強烈な一撃を繰り出します。",
  "Hold <symbol=button_r1> and press <symbol=button_shikaku> to adopt a shooting stance. This allows you to fire while in motion.": "<symbol=button_r1>を押しながら<symbol=button_shikaku>で構え射撃\n移動しながら銃弾を発射できます。",
  "After landing an attack with <symbol=button_r2>, press <symbol=button_shikaku> repeatedly for consecutive attacks until the Heat Gauge is depleted.": "<symbol=button_r2>の攻撃を当てた後、<symbol=button_shikaku>連打\n最初の一撃を当てた後は、ヒートゲージがなくなるまで\n<symbol=button_shikaku>連打で連続攻撃が可能です。",
  "Press and hold <symbol=button_r2> to alternate between gun and sword attacks. This will expend the Heat Gauge while active.": "<symbol=button_r2>を押している間\n銃撃と斬撃の回転攻撃を行います。\n発動中はヒートゲージを消費し続けます。",
  "Press and hold <symbol=button_r2>, then release to mark surrounding foes.": "<symbol=button_r2>長押し後、放す\n周囲の敵に印が付きそこに向けて銃を乱射します。",
  "Hold, then release <symbol=button_r2>. The moment this attack lands, use <symbol=button_l_stick>+<symbol=button_shikaku> to strike another target. Each attack expends the Heat Gauge.": "<symbol=button_r2>長押し後、放す\n攻撃が当たる瞬間に次の標的の方向へ<symbol=button_l_stick>＋<symbol=button_shikaku>で\n次の一撃を放つことができます。\n攻撃のたびにヒートゲージを消費します。",
  "In Wild Dancer, press <symbol=button_sankaku> to attack with your firearm.": "<symbol=button_sankaku>で射撃\n乱舞の型は<symbol=button_sankaku>で銃による攻撃を行います。",
  "Press <symbol=button_sankaku> to fire your equipped special ammo.": "<symbol=button_sankaku>特殊弾攻撃\n装備している特殊弾を発射します。",
  "While shooting with <symbol=button_shikaku>, press <symbol=button_sankaku> to fire a hail of bullets horizontally.": "<symbol=button_shikaku>で射撃中に<symbol=button_sankaku>\n広範囲に銃弾をばら撒いて攻撃します。",
  "In Wild Dancer, press <symbol=button_shikaku> to attack with your sword.": "<symbol=button_shikaku>で斬撃\n乱舞の型は<symbol=button_shikaku>で刀による攻撃を行います。",
  "Press <symbol=button_shikaku> repeatedly to perform a Rush Combo.": "<symbol=button_shikaku>で連撃\n敵を攻撃してみましょう。",
  "Press <symbol=button_shikaku> repeatedly for consecutive shots. Repeatedly shooting an enemy makes them drop their weapon.": "<symbol=button_shikaku>で連続射撃\n連続で銃弾を敵に当てると敵が武器を落します。",
  "Press <symbol=button_shikaku> repeatedly to perform consecutive attacks.": "<symbol=button_shikaku>で連続攻撃",
  "Press <symbol=button_shikaku> to fire. Shots become less accurate at too far of a range.": "<symbol=button_shikaku>で銃撃\n銃弾は距離が離れると当たりづらくなります。",
  "After <symbol=button_shikaku>, press <symbol=button_sankaku> for a Finishing Blow.": "<symbol=button_shikaku>連撃後　<symbol=button_sankaku>で大攻撃",
  "After pressing <symbol=button_shikaku>, perform a Finishing Blow with <symbol=button_sankaku>.": "<symbol=button_shikaku>連撃後　<symbol=button_sankaku>で大攻撃\n大きな一撃で敵をダウンさせましょう。",
  "After <symbol=button_shikaku>, press and hold <symbol=button_sankaku> to charge up and increase the power of your Finishing Blow.": "<symbol=button_shikaku>連続攻撃後　<symbol=button_sankaku>長押し\n力を溜めることで、技の威力が上昇します",
  "Press <symbol=button_up> to switch to the Wild Dancer.": "<symbol=button_up>を入力して「乱舞の型」に切り替えてください。",
  "Swordsman is a style which employs charged attacks and a variety of defenses and counters.\n\nSummer Rainfall: an exclusive skill of the Swordsman. Press <symbol=button_maru> to break the enemy's guard.\n\nWhen fighting against other sword users, it is imperative to chip away at their defense while using <symbol=button_l1> to keep your own guard up.": "一刀の型は、力を溜めての大きな一撃と\n多彩な防御、返し技が特徴の型です。\n\n【一刀の型専用技】\n五月雨崩し：<symbol=button_maru>　敵の防御を崩せる\n\n刀同士の戦いでは、相手の防御を崩しつつ攻撃し\n敵の攻撃は<symbol=button_l1>でしっかり防御することが重要になります。",
  "Wild Dancer is a style that employs continuous waves of sword and gun attacks.\n\nRemnant Silhouette: an exclusive skill of the Wild Dancer. Press <symbol=button_batsu> to halt your attack. Try following <symbol=button_batsu> with <symbol=button_shikaku>, <symbol=button_sankaku>, or <symbol=button_maru> to change up your offense and confuse the enemy.": "乱舞の型は、斬撃と銃撃による波状攻撃で\n絶え間なく攻撃することができる型です。\n\n【乱舞の型専用技】\n影残し：<symbol=button_batsu>で攻撃を中断して次の攻撃へ移ることができる\n\n<symbol=button_shikaku><symbol=button_sankaku><symbol=button_maru>の攻撃の合間に<symbol=button_batsu>を挟むことで\n素早く次の攻撃を行い、敵を翻弄していきましょう。",
  "Press <symbol=button_batsu> just before hitting the ground to break your fall.": "倒れ込む瞬間に<symbol=button_batsu>\n受け身を取って立ち上がります。",
  "Make effective use of parries. Press <symbol=button_l1> just before an enemy attack connects to parry, even while on the offensive.": "受け流しを有効活用しましょう。\n\n敵の攻撃が当たる直前に<symbol=button_l1>\n攻撃中でも受け流しを行うことができます。",
  "Try shooting Enhanced Rounds. Enhanced Rounds are bullets that have no special effects but are extremely powerful.": "強化弾を撃ってみましょう。\n\n強化弾は特殊な効果はないものの威力の高い弾丸です。",
  "Tilt <symbol=button_l_stick> back and press <symbol=button_shikaku> to quickly shoot an enemy behind you.": "後ろ方向へ<symbol=button_l_stick>を入力して<symbol=button_shikaku>\n後ろから近づく敵に即座に銃撃を行います。",
  "While attacking, press <symbol=button_batsu> to cancel your movement.\nDuring a <symbol=button_shikaku> combo, press <symbol=button_batsu> then <symbol=button_shikaku> again to unleash a flurry of attacks.": "攻撃中に<symbol=button_batsu>で攻撃を中断して次の攻撃に移行。\n<symbol=button_shikaku>連撃中に<symbol=button_batsu>を入力して\n再度<symbol=button_shikaku>から連続攻撃を繰り出しましょう。",
  "Press <symbol=button_l1> just before an enemy attack connects to parry it.": "敵の攻撃が当たる直前に<symbol=button_l1>\n相手の攻撃を受け流すことができます。",
  "Now please, defeat your enemies.": "敵を全員倒してください。",
  "Brawler is a fighting style that employs martial arts, parries, and objects in the environment.\n\nWar Cry Counter: an exclusive skill of the Brawler. After parrying with <symbol=button_l1>, you'll become invincible for a length of time. Parry enemy attacks with <symbol=button_l1> to create opportunities to counterattack.\n\nRemember, though, that while barehanded you have no defense against blades.": "格闘の型は、体術と周囲にある物だけで戦う型です。\n受け流しからの強力な反撃も大きな特徴です。\n\n【格闘の型専用技　反撃ノ鬨】\n<symbol=button_l1>で受け流し後、一定時間無敵状態になる\n\n素手なので刃物を防御することはできません。\n敵の攻撃は<symbol=button_l1>で受け流して反撃の好機を作りましょう。",
  "The orange gauge in the top left represents Ryoma's health. Be aware that if it reaches zero, the game is over.": "画面左上のオレンジ色の\nゲージは主人公の体力を\n表しています。\n\n体力がゼロになると力尽き\nゲームオーバーとなるので\n注意しましょう。",
  "The blue gauge in the top left is the Heat Gauge, which is used to activate special Heat Actions. The Heat Gauge fills as you attack and depletes when you take damage.": "画面左上の青いゲージは大技を\n発動するために使用する\nヒートゲージです。\n\n敵に攻撃を当てると上昇し\n攻撃を受けると減少します。",
  "Gunman is a style that allows you to deliver unilateral attacks through long-distance shooting.\n\nRoaring Fusillade: an exclusive skill of the Gunman. During a <symbol=button_shikaku> combo, press <symbol=button_sankaku> to fire in a wide arc.\n\nThe Gunman style becomes less effective as enemies approach. Try to maintain your distance.": "短銃の型は、遠距離からの射撃で\n一方的に攻撃することができる型です。\n\n【短銃の型専用技】\n轟撃ち：<symbol=button_shikaku>連撃中に<symbol=button_sankaku>で拡散射撃\n\n短銃の型は敵に近づかれると不利になります。\n敵と距離を取り攻撃をするように心がけましょう。",
  "<kf:23>Activate skill with <symbol=button_l2> + <symbol=button_batsu>": "<kf:23><symbol=button_l2> + <symbol=button_batsu> でスキル発動",
  "<kf:23>Activate skills by pressing <symbol=button_l2> + <symbol=button_down>": "<kf:23><symbol=button_l2> + <symbol=button_down> でスキル発動",
  "<kf:23>Recover health by pressing <symbol=button_l2> + <symbol=button_left> ": "<kf:23><symbol=button_l2> + <symbol=button_left> で体力回復",
  "<kf:23>Heal with <symbol=button_l2> + <symbol=button_shikaku>": "<kf:23><symbol=button_l2> + <symbol=button_shikaku> で体力回復",
  "<symbol=button_batsu> to evade or <symbol=button_l1> to parry.": "<symbol=button_batsu>で回避　敵の攻撃に合わせて<symbol=button_l1>で受け流し",
  "<symbol=button_batsu> to evade, then <symbol=button_batsu> or <symbol=button_l_stick> + <symbol=button_batsu>.": "<symbol=button_batsu>で回避中に<symbol=button_batsu>\nあるいは<symbol=button_l_stick>＋<symbol=button_batsu>",
  "<symbol=button_maru> while evading with <symbol=button_batsu>.": "<symbol=button_batsu>で回避中に<symbol=button_maru>",
  "<symbol=button_sankaku> while evading with <symbol=button_batsu>.": "<symbol=button_batsu>で回避中に<symbol=button_sankaku>",
  "<symbol=button_shikaku> while evading with <symbol=button_batsu>.": "<symbol=button_batsu>で回避中に<symbol=button_shikaku>",
  "<symbol=button_sankaku> while guarding with <symbol=button_l1>.": "<symbol=button_l1>で防御中に<symbol=button_sankaku>",
  "<symbol=button_maru><symbol=button_maru><symbol=button_maru>for Phoenix Frenzy.": "<symbol=button_maru><symbol=button_maru><symbol=button_maru>で鳳凰陣",
  "<symbol=button_maru> to grab, then <symbol=button_maru> to throw or <symbol=button_shikaku> to attack.": "<symbol=button_maru>で掴み　<symbol=button_maru>で投げ　<symbol=button_shikaku>で攻撃",
  "<symbol=button_maru> to grab, then move to a wall. <symbol=button_sankaku> when the Heat icon is displayed.": "<symbol=button_maru>で掴み壁際へ移動して<symbol=button_sankaku>\n「極」表示で発動可能",
